BEE DY JARROO ER CHO PHREISH AGGLAGH ESHYN

216
00:11:59,370 --> 00:12:01,289
AS MANNAGH ROW EH ER VE EGINIT DY

217
00:12:01,289 --> 00:12:04,529
CHOOILLEENEY CURRYM LIORISH NY SMOO NA COOISHYN DOOINNOIL

218
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:06,960
CHA NODDAGH OO RIEAU ER NGHOAILL AYNS LAUEYN

219
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:11,189
RISH MINNID NY GHAA VA SHIN WHEESH CURRIT

220
00:12:11,250 --> 00:12:14,159
DAASYN NY REN SHIN JEEAGHYN ER Y CHOVIN

221
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,769
AGH TRA REN SHIN

222
00:12:18,269 --> 00:12:22,950
CRE'N YINDYS USHTIT VEIH YN DERREY YEH DAN

223
00:12:22,950 --> 00:12:24,000
JEH ELLEY JEANT

224
00:12:25,049 --> 00:12:28,860
REN SHIN BLAAGHEY CHOOID JEEAN DY REN ARTHUR

225
00:12:28,919 --> 00:12:30,959
YEEARREE ERYNOYR DY ROW EH MY HIE ER

226
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:34,110
Y LAARE AS HAINK EH AS EEAST ER

227
00:12:34,110 --> 00:12:40,740
NEESHT AS EISHT REN SHENN BOGGOIL NEUCHADJIN BRISHEY

228
00:12:40,740 --> 00:12:43,890
STIAGH SYN EDDIN ECHEY AS REN EH IMMAN

229
00:12:43,889 --> 00:12:47,129
ERSOOYL DY BOLLAGH RO OMMIJYS SCOAGH VA NY

230
00:12:47,129 --> 00:12:47,669
LHIE ORRY

231
00:12:49,139 --> 00:12:52,620
AYNS SHEN SY CHOSSYN TA ROUYR DY LEIH

232
00:12:52,620 --> 00:12:55,980
NY SODJEY YN LHEID EAJEE AS VA WHEESH

233
00:12:55,980 --> 00:12:58,410
ALL ER VE AIN ROISH AS VA SHIN

234
00:12:58,409 --> 00:13:00,750
ER JEET DY CHUR DWOAIE DA DY ROW

235
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:02,730
YN OBBYR DY STROIE ER VE CUR RISH

236
00:13:03,210 --> 00:13:05,940
ER-CHEEID DAN AYR AS VA'N CHAAYR SMOO ECHEY

237
00:13:05,940 --> 00:13:09,810
DY YANNOO EH AGH LUS EE MOGHREY ROSH

238
00:13:09,809 --> 00:13:13,829
SHIN ER VAKIN OIE CHALSE BIO LESH MILJID

239
00:13:14,070 --> 00:13:16,860
AS GLEN OO JEHN EDDIN ECK GYN CUR

240
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:17,370
SOYLLEY

241
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:20,730
SFEER EH DY ROW LURG VA SHIN ER

242
00:13:20,730 --> 00:13:24,149
NAKIN AD TRA V'EE BIO NY MONNAGHYN DY

243
00:13:24,149 --> 00:13:29,370
CHIARAIL USHTEY FEEAL NY STIUREYDER AGH SMIAN DOOIN

244
00:13:29,370 --> 00:13:33,360
VAD SHIAULLEY ERYNOYR DY ROW AD COWRAGHEY MAGH

245
00:13:33,570 --> 00:13:36,329
Y FIRRINYS EC DAN VEN AS ER MIE

246
00:13:36,330 --> 00:13:36,750
NURREE

247
00:13:43,379 --> 00:13:45,750
REIR ELLEY ESHYN CHYNDAA SY GHAELG DYS GOLL

248
00:13:45,750 --> 00:13:48,689
ER JANNOO SHIAGHTIN ER SHIAGHTIN LURG C'RAAD NAAGAIL

249
00:13:49,019 --> 00:13:52,950
JEH DROGHYANNOO LIORISH PROM STHOLKEY AS MYR SHOH

250
00:13:52,950 --> 00:13:55,289
SHEN EH AS VEIH'N OO ANMAGH SHOH JEH

251
00:13:55,289 --> 00:13:57,000
ABBYR SHEN REESHT SLIENNOO

252
00:14:12,809 --> 00:14:13,109
AS

253
00:14:23,669 --> 00:14:23,969
HIE

254
00:14:36,299 --> 00:14:36,599
ISH

